{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07547","headline":"咏史十一首 九 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀主相诸葛，功高名亦尊。\n驱驰千万衆，怒目瞰中原。\n曹伯任公孙，国亡身不存。\n社宫久芜没，白鴈犹飞翻。\n勿言君臣合，可以济黎元。\n爲蜀谅不易，如曹难复论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}